Main_Char: (Charlotte is napping on the grass, it would be better to not wake her)
- Don't wake her...
	Main_Char: (She looks peaceful, I'm happy she likes it here. I'll go talk to some of the others.)
- Wake her...
	Main_Char: (I go up to her and shake her)
	Main_Char: Charlotte! wake up!
	sibling (shock): ugh...
	sibling (shock): what...why'd you wake me.
	Main_Char: Why are you sleeping on the grass?
	sibling (sad): ...because it's comfortable...
	Main_Char: Oh, sorry for waking you then.
	Main_Char: (she looks at me annoyed and lays back down, while saying nothing)